  "title": "Orange Oatmeal Muffins",
  "description": "These are moist muffins with a hint of orange flavoring in it. I received this recipe from my great aunt at the time I was married.",
  "authors": [
    "Doreen Wetheral"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-01-08T08:35:31-05:00",
